{
    "title": "OBD JScan",
    "description": "What is OBD JScan?\r\n\r\nOBD JScan is powerful Jeep diagnostic application. JScan allows reading standard Diagnostic Trouble Codes (emission related), Generic Live Data and much more. That's not all. JScan can access all modules avilable on your vehicle. ABS, Steering Column, Automatic Transmission, Radio, Sway Bar, Hvac and much more. \r\n\r\nWhat can I Do with JScan?\r\nJScan allows you to access, diagnostic trouble codes and Live Data in all modules. You can easily Read, Clear, Share vehicle Trouble Codes. View Live Data from all sensors in vehicle. View and Change vehicle settings like tires size, axle ratio, DRL Settings, and more. Identify modules, VIN, Part Number.\r\n\r\nSome supported cars:\r\nJeep Wrangler JK,\r\nJeep Wrangler JL/JT - additional hardware required to bypass security gateway* \r\nJeep Grand Cherokee WK\r\nJeep Grand Cherokee WK2 11-13\r\nJeep Grand Cherokee WK2 14-20 - 18+ - additional hardware required to bypass security gateway*\r\nJeep Commander  XK\r\nJeep Liberty/Cherokee KK,\r\nJeep Compass, Jeep Patriot   MK\r\n\r\nDodge Avenger,\r\nDodge Grand Caravan RT, \r\nDodge Journey - 18+ - additional hardware required to bypass security gateway*,\r\nDodge Caliber,\r\nDodge Durango 2004-2009,\r\nDodge Durango 2011-2013,\r\nDodge Durango 2014-2020 - 18+ - additional hardware required to bypass security gateway*,\r\nDodge Ram,\r\nDodge Nitro,\r\nDodge Magnum,\r\nDodge Challenger - 08-14,\r\nDodge Challenger - 14+,\r\nDodge Charger - 06 - 10,\r\nDodge Charger - 11+,\r\n\r\nChrysler Town & Country  RT,\r\nChrysler 200,\r\nChrysler 300C,\r\nChrysler 300,\r\nChrysler Sebring,\r\nChrysler Aspen,\r\nand more..\r\n\r\n* WK2 / Durango/ Journey -  all 2018+ models requires securit bypass cable\r\n* JL requires security bypass cable\r\n* JT requires security bypass cable\r\n* http://jscan.net/jl-jt-security-bypass/ - learn more here\r\n\r\nSupported and recommended OBD ELM327 adapters:\r\nBluetooth:\r\n- OBD ELM327 iCar Vgate v2.0 Bluetooth.\r\n- OBD ELM327 iCar Vgate v3.0 Bluetooth.\r\n- OBD ELM327 iCar Vgate v4.0 Bluetooth LE - this adapter will also work with iOS\r\n- OBD LinkMX Bluetooth\r\n- OBD LinkMX+ Bluetooth\r\n\r\n- OBD adapters based on STN1170 chip\r\n\r\nWiFi:\r\n- OBD ELM327 iCar Vgate v2.0 WiFi.\r\n- OBD ELM327 iCar Vgate v3.0 WiFi.\r\n- OBD ELM327 iCar Vgate v4.0 WiFi.\r\n\r\nWarning!!! There are reports on connection issues when using some cheap \"clones\" of ELM327 (mostly marked as v2.1)!\r\n\r\nMore info about supported and recommended adapters: \r\nhttp://jscan.net/supported-and-not-supported-obd-adapters/\r\n\r\nFacebook:\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/obdjscan/\r\n\r\nWebsite: \r\nhttp://jscan.net/",
    "descriptionHTML": "What is OBD JScan?<br><br>OBD JScan is powerful Jeep diagnostic application. JScan allows reading standard Diagnostic Trouble Codes (emission related), Generic Live Data and much more. That&#39;s not all. JScan can access all modules avilable on your vehicle. ABS, Steering Column, Automatic Transmission, Radio, Sway Bar, Hvac and much more. <br><br>What can I Do with JScan?<br>JScan allows you to access, diagnostic trouble codes and Live Data in all modules. You can easily Read, Clear, Share vehicle Trouble Codes. View Live Data from all sensors in vehicle. View and Change vehicle settings like tires size, axle ratio, DRL Settings, and more. Identify modules, VIN, Part Number.<br><br>Some supported cars:<br>Jeep Wrangler JK,<br>Jeep Wrangler JL/JT - additional hardware required to bypass security gateway* <br>Jeep Grand Cherokee WK<br>Jeep Grand Cherokee WK2 11-13<br>Jeep Grand Cherokee WK2 14-20 - 18+ - additional hardware required to bypass security gateway*<br>Jeep Commander  XK<br>Jeep Liberty/Cherokee KK,<br>Jeep Compass, Jeep Patriot   MK<br><br>Dodge Avenger,<br>Dodge Grand Caravan RT, <br>Dodge Journey - 18+ - additional hardware required to bypass security gateway*,<br>Dodge Caliber,<br>Dodge Durango 2004-2009,<br>Dodge Durango 2011-2013,<br>Dodge Durango 2014-2020 - 18+ - additional hardware required to bypass security gateway*,<br>Dodge Ram,<br>Dodge Nitro,<br>Dodge Magnum,<br>Dodge Challenger - 08-14,<br>Dodge Challenger - 14+,<br>Dodge Charger - 06 - 10,<br>Dodge Charger - 11+,<br><br>Chrysler Town &amp; Country  RT,<br>Chrysler 200,<br>Chrysler 300C,<br>Chrysler 300,<br>Chrysler Sebring,<br>Chrysler Aspen,<br>and more..<br><br>* WK2 / Durango/ Journey -  all 2018+ models requires securit bypass cable<br>* JL requires security bypass cable<br>* JT requires security bypass cable<br>* http://jscan.net/jl-jt-security-bypass/ - learn more here<br><br>Supported and recommended OBD ELM327 adapters:<br>Bluetooth:<br>- OBD ELM327 iCar Vgate v2.0 Bluetooth.<br>- OBD ELM327 iCar Vgate v3.0 Bluetooth.<br>- OBD ELM327 iCar Vgate v4.0 Bluetooth LE - this adapter will also work with iOS<br>- OBD LinkMX Bluetooth<br>- OBD LinkMX+ Bluetooth<br><br>- OBD adapters based on STN1170 chip<br><br>WiFi:<br>- OBD ELM327 iCar Vgate v2.0 WiFi.<br>- OBD ELM327 iCar Vgate v3.0 WiFi.<br>- OBD ELM327 iCar Vgate v4.0 WiFi.<br><br>Warning!!! There are reports on connection issues when using some cheap &quot;clones&quot; of ELM327 (mostly marked as v2.1)!<br><br>More info about supported and recommended adapters: <br>http://jscan.net/supported-and-not-supported-obd-adapters/<br><br>Facebook:<br>https://www.facebook.com/obdjscan/<br><br>Website: <br>http://jscan.net/",
